  "title": "HTTP/2: Send compressed DATA frames to follow tap after decompression",
  "description": "If DATA frames have a content-encoding, and we plan to decompress them\n(because decompression is enabled and it's not a partial content body),\nthen send DATA frames to the follow tap after decompression.\n\nOtherwise, continue to send the data to the follow tap immediately\n(in case, for example, we don't have the entire stream.)\n\nPing #18239",
